    title: "Delete " + targets.length + " snapshot" + (many ? "s" : ""),
    message:
      "This removes " + (many ? "these snapshots" : "this snapshot") +
      " permanently. The guests themselves are untouched, but you lose the " +
      "restore point" + (many ? "s" : "") + ":<br><br><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">" +
      targets.map((t) => t.vmid + "  " + t.name).join("\n") + "</pre>",
    okText: "Delete", danger: true,
    // The dialog renders its own "Type DELETE to confirm" label and gates OK
    // on it, so more than one at a time is typed rather than clicked.
